sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Caller
  participant R as Ravel CLI
  participant W as Rhai worker
  participant H as Harness run (claude -p)
  C->>R: start-session --kind KIND --prompt TEXT
  R->>R: read settings, resolve config.rhai
  R->>W: re-execute own binary (empty environment, fd 3)
  W->>R: hello with build identity
  R->>W: request map and entry source
  W->>R: module request for "routes"
  R->>W: module source (measured)
  W->>W: run the top level, then select(request, context)
  W->>R: host call ravel::run_harness(request map)
  R->>H: the runner launches the job, with a fresh result channel
  Note over H: the harness signs in with the owner's own sign-in
  H-->>R: JSON answer on stdout, then exit 0
  R->>R: reap the run, check that its group is gone
  R-->>W: result map (status exited, exitCode 0, stdout)
  W->>W: json_parse, json_check, then build the selection
  W->>R: result: a Selected map
  R->>R: check the selection, reap the worker, remove its directory
  R->>R: resolve the program, allocate the session's result channel
  Note over R: the runner launches the managed process
  R-->>C: the opaque result on stdout, after cleanup
